---
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro'
import DownloadButtons from '../DownloadButtons.astro'

interface Props { locale?: 'en' | 'vi'; base: string }
const { locale = 'en', base } = Astro.props
const vi = locale === 'vi'
const t = (en: string, vn: string) => vi ? vn : en
const vbase = vi ? (base.replace('../', '') || './') : base
---
<Page
  title={t('Prompt Library for AI Design: copy-paste prompts for banners, overlays &amp; decks | Oia', 'Gợi ý mô tả AI: prompt dùng sẵn cho banner, khung livestream và slide | Oia')}
  description={t(
    'A curated library of AI image prompts for e-commerce banners, livestream overlays, posters, menus and presentations, the prompts marked tested were verified against live Codex image generation. Copy, paste, generate.',
    'Thư viện prompt tạo ảnh AI cho banner thương mại, khung livestream, poster, thực đơn và bài thuyết trình; các prompt gắn tested đã kiểm chứng qua Codex generation thật. Sao chép, dán, tạo ảnh.')}
  ogTitle={t('Prompt Library for AI Design | Oia', 'Gợi ý mô tả AI | Oia')}
  ogDescription={t('Copy-paste prompts for flash-sale banners, livestream overlays, posters, menus and decks, tested ones marked.', 'Prompt dùng sẵn cho banner sale, khung livestream, poster, thực đơn, slide; bản đã test được đánh dấu.')}
  canonical={`https://oia.solutions/${vi ? 'vi/' : ''}prompts/`}
  base={base} locale={locale} route="prompts/"
>
<header class="pageHero">
  <p class="kicker">{t('Prompt library', 'Gợi ý mô tả')}</p>
  <h1>{t('Prompts that print sellable designs.', 'Mô tả cho ra thiết kế bán được.')}</h1>
  <p class="lede">{t('Copy, paste, generate. Only prompts marked <em>tested</em> have run against a live model; the rest are starting points.', 'Sao chép, dán, tạo ảnh. Chỉ các prompt gắn nhãn <em>tested</em> đã chạy qua model thật; còn lại là điểm khởi đầu. Prompt giữ nguyên tiếng Anh cho kết quả ổn định nhất; bạn cũng có thể mô tả bằng tiếng Việt.')}</p>
  <DownloadButtons rowClass="ctaRow" anchorId="download" installHref={`${vbase}install/`} locale={locale} ghost={{ href: `${vbase}templates/`, label: t('Browse templates', 'Xem thư viện mẫu') }} />
</header>

<main class="pageMain">

  <h2 class="catH">{t('E-commerce banners', 'Banner thương mại điện tử')}</h2>
  <p class="catNote">{t('Sizes that match the prompt: Shopee 1:1 · TikTok Shop 1:1 · Lazada 1:1', 'Kích thước đi kèm prompt: Shopee 1:1 · TikTok Shop 1:1 · Lazada 1:1')}</p>
  <div class="promptGrid">
    <div class="promptCard">
      <h3>Milk-tea flash sale, baked typography</h3>
      <div class="chips"><span class="ok">tested</span><span>Shopee 1:1</span></div>
      <pre>Milk-tea flash-sale banner for a Shopee shop, 20% off today, ALL TEXT IN ENGLISH: "FLASH SALE", "20% OFF TODAY". Warm afternoon light, appetizing product photography, bold promotional typography</pre>
      <div class="row"><button class="copyBtn">Copy prompt</button><span class="mono" style="font-size:10px">≈ 1 image</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="promptCard">
      <h3>Clean plate for own copy layers</h3>
      <div class="chips"><span>any size</span><span>text-free artwork</span></div>
      <pre>Milk-tea product banner on a warm cream studio background with soft window light, leave the top third and right half calm and uncluttered for text. No text anywhere in the image.</pre>
      <div class="row"><button class="copyBtn">Copy prompt</button><span class="mono" style="font-size:10px">toggle: editable text</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="promptCard">
      <h3>Cosmetics launch, editorial</h3>
      <div class="chips"><span>Post 4:5</span></div>
      <pre>Editorial skincare launch banner, glass serum bottle on travertine stone, soft shadows, sage and cream palette, ALL TEXT: "NEW", "RADIANCE SERUM", "LAUNCHING SOON". High-end minimal typography</pre>
      <div class="row"><button class="copyBtn">Copy prompt</button><span class="mono" style="font-size:10px">≈ 1 image</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="promptCard">
      <h3>Fashion drop, bold poster type</h3>
      <div class="chips"><span>Post 4:5</span></div>
      <pre>Streetwear drop banner, model in oversized hoodie against a concrete wall, hard flash photography, ALL TEXT: "DROP 07", "LIMITED", "FRIDAY 8PM". Chunky condensed uppercase typography</pre>
      <div class="row"><button class="copyBtn">Copy prompt</button><span class="mono" style="font-size:10px">≈ 1 image</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="catH">{t('Livestream overlays', 'Khung livestream')}</h2>
  <p class="catNote">{t('Generate at Livestream overlay 1080×1920, export as transparent PNG, safe zones built in.', 'Tạo ở kích thước Livestream overlay 1080×1920, xuất PNG trong suốt, vùng an toàn có sẵn.')}</p>
  <div class="promptGrid">
    <div class="promptCard">
      <h3>Flash-sale price card</h3>
      <div class="chips"><span>1080×1920</span></div>
      <pre>Livestream price card for a TikTok live sale, glossy red 3D "FLASH SALE" headline, "$8.90" struck through, huge "$5.90" beneath, gold outline and light rays, transparent background around the card only</pre>
      <div class="row"><button class="copyBtn">Copy prompt</button><span class="mono" style="font-size:10px">≈ 1 image</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="promptCard">
      <h3>Freeship badge</h3>
      <div class="chips"><span>1080×1920</span></div>
      <pre>Round livestream badge, "FREESHIP" in bold white letters on a glossy orange circle, small "ALL ORDERS" ribbon, soft drop shadow, sticker style, isolated on plain background</pre>
      <div class="row"><button class="copyBtn">Copy prompt</button><span class="mono" style="font-size:10px">≈ 1 image</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="promptCard">
      <h3>Countdown frame</h3>
      <div class="chips"><span>1080×1920</span></div>
      <pre>Vertical livestream countdown frame, neon purple border with "ENDS IN" header panel at the top and a large empty time slot, cyber sale energy, transparent center</pre>
      <div class="row"><button class="copyBtn">Copy prompt</button><span class="mono" style="font-size:10px">≈ 1 image</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="promptCard">
      <h3>Shopee live cover</h3>
      <div class="chips"><span>500×500 ★</span></div>
      <pre>Shopee live cover, cozy milk-tea shop scene with cups and pearls, warm shop lights, ALL TEXT: "MILK TEA LIVE", "8PM TONIGHT", "UP TO 50%". Cheerful marketplace typography</pre>
      <div class="row"><button class="copyBtn">Copy prompt</button><span class="mono" style="font-size:10px">≈ 1 image</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="catH">{t('Repaint edits: change one thing, keep the style', 'Vẽ lại: đổi một chi tiết, giữ phong cách')}</h2>
  <p class="catNote">{t('Select the layer you mean (or @ it) before sending, Oia sends exactly that image to the model.', 'Chọn đúng layer cần sửa (hoặc gắn @) trước khi gửi, Oia gửi đúng ảnh đó cho model.')}</p>
  <div class="promptGrid">
    <div class="promptCard">
      <h3>Change the price</h3>
      <div class="chips"><span class="ok">tested</span><span>@ the layer</span></div>
      <pre>change the text: '20% OFF TODAY' becomes '30% OFF TODAY', keep the typography style, colors, drinks and everything else exactly the same</pre>
      <div class="row"><button class="copyBtn">Copy prompt</button><span class="mono" style="font-size:10px">≈ 1 image</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="promptCard">
      <h3>Moodier background</h3>
      <div class="chips"><span class="ok">tested</span><span>@ the layer</span></div>
      <pre>make the background darker and moodier</pre>
      <div class="row"><button class="copyBtn">Copy prompt</button><span class="mono" style="font-size:10px">≈ 1 image</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="promptCard">
      <h3>Swap the product</h3>
      <div class="chips"><span>@ the layer</span></div>
      <pre>replace the cake with a stack of muffins, keep the table, teacup, colors and lighting exactly the same</pre>
      <div class="row"><button class="copyBtn">Copy prompt</button><span class="mono" style="font-size:10px">≈ 1 image</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="promptCard">
      <h3>Seasonal restyle</h3>
      <div class="chips"><span>@ the layer</span></div>
      <pre>restyle this banner for Christmas, deep green and gold palette, subtle snow bokeh, keep the products, layout and text style exactly the same</pre>
      <div class="row"><button class="copyBtn">Copy prompt</button><span class="mono" style="font-size:10px">≈ 1 image</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="catH">{t('Posters &amp; menus', 'Poster và thực đơn')}</h2>
  <p class="catNote">{t('Poster 1360×2048 · Menu A4 2480×3508', 'Poster 1360×2048 · Thực đơn A4 2480×3508')}</p>
  <div class="promptGrid">
    <div class="promptCard">
      <h3>Coffee-shop menu board</h3>
      <div class="chips"><span>A4</span></div>
      <pre>Coffee shop menu poster, chalkboard texture, hand-drawn latte art doodles, ALL TEXT: "MENU", "ESPRESSO 25K", "LATTE 35K", "MATCHA 40K". Warm handwritten typography, clear hierarchy</pre>
      <div class="row"><button class="copyBtn">Copy prompt</button><span class="mono" style="font-size:10px">≈ 1 image</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="promptCard">
      <h3>City festival poster</h3>
      <div class="chips"><span class="ok">template</span><span>Poster</span></div>
      <pre>City sound festival poster, brutalist architecture photography in bright blue, ALL TEXT: "CITY SOUND FEST", "SAT 21.09", "ROOFTOP STAGE". Bold swiss grid typography</pre>
      <div class="row"><button class="copyBtn">Copy prompt</button><span class="mono" style="font-size:10px">bundled template</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="promptCard">
      <h3>Grand-opening poster</h3>
      <div class="chips"><span>Poster</span></div>
      <pre>Grand-opening poster for a bubble tea shop, confetti and pearls raining over a cream background, ALL TEXT: "GRAND OPENING", "BUY 1 GET 1", "THIS SATURDAY". Playful rounded typography</pre>
      <div class="row"><button class="copyBtn">Copy prompt</button><span class="mono" style="font-size:10px">≈ 1 image</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="promptCard">
      <h3>Matcha everyday poster</h3>
      <div class="chips"><span class="ok">template</span><span>Poster</span></div>
      <pre>Matcha editorial poster, dark green ceramic bowl, steam, quiet morning light, ALL TEXT: "MATCHA EVERY DAY.", "GOOD TEA, BRIGHTER DAYS". Cream serif typography</pre>
      <div class="row"><button class="copyBtn">Copy prompt</button><span class="mono" style="font-size:10px">bundled template</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="catH">{t('Presentations', 'Bài thuyết trình')}</h2>
  <p class="catNote">{t('Presentation 16:9 · set pages 3-9 and review the outline before a single image is spent.', 'Thuyết trình 16:9 · đặt 3-9 trang rồi duyệt dàn ý trước khi tốn ảnh nào.')}</p>
  <div class="promptGrid">
    <div class="promptCard">
      <h3>Pitch deck, 6 slides</h3>
      <div class="chips"><span>16:9</span><span>6 pages</span></div>
      <pre>A 6-page investor pitch deck for a Vietnamese bubble-tea chain, clean editorial layout, warm cream and green palette, one idea per slide, minimal text, charts where numbers matter</pre>
      <div class="row"><button class="copyBtn">Copy prompt</button><span class="mono" style="font-size:10px">outline first</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="promptCard">
      <h3>Product-launch deck</h3>
      <div class="chips"><span>16:9</span><span>8 pages</span></div>
      <pre>An 8-page product-launch deck for a skincare serum, before/after product shots, ingredient callouts, roadmap slide, soft sage palette, generous whitespace</pre>
      <div class="row"><button class="copyBtn">Copy prompt</button><span class="mono" style="font-size:10px">outline first</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

</main>
</Page>
<script>document.querySelectorAll('.copyBtn').forEach(function(btn){
  btn.addEventListener('click', function(){
    var pre = btn.closest('.promptCard').querySelector('pre');
    navigator.clipboard.writeText(pre.textContent.trim()).then(function(){
      btn.textContent = 'Copied ✓'; btn.classList.add('done');
      setTimeout(function(){ btn.textContent = 'Copy prompt'; btn.classList.remove('done'); }, 1600);
    });
  });
});</script>
